"TLS-Crypt": "TLS 加密密钥",
"Key for TLS authentication and session encryption. Full format option (to disable - comment with #).": "用于 TLS 认证与会话加密的密钥。可填完整指令，不需要时用 # 注释。",
"TLS-Version-Min": "最低 TLS 版本",
"Sets the minimum TLS version to accept from the peer. Full format option (to disable - comment with #).": "允许对端使用的最低 TLS 版本。可填完整指令，不需要时用 # 注释。",
"Remote-Cert-TLS": "对端证书类型校验",
"Security option for clients, to ensure that the host they connect to is a designated server. Full format option (to disable - comment with #).": "安全选项：确保客户端连到的是合法服务端。可填完整指令，不需要时用 # 注释。",
"Encrypt data channel packets with this cipher algorithm.": "数据通道使用的加密算法。",
"Ncp-Ciphers": "候选加密算法",
"The list of ciphers that the client can use.": "客户端可协商使用的加密算法列表。",
"Server (Trusted VPN Subnet)": "服务端网段（受信任 VPN 网段）",
"In Server mode supplys a Trusted VPN subnet for OpenVPN clients \n         to draw &quot;VLAN1&quot; addresses from. You can ser server-bridge configuration here for tap mode.": "Server 模式下为客户端分配的受信任 VPN 网段（VLAN1）。tap 模式可在此填 server-bridge 配置。",
"Route (Guest VPN subnet)": "路由（访客 VPN 网段）",
"Used to route (&quot;route [Guest subnet]&quot;) for Guest Network to for &quot;VLAN2&quot; (Guest Users) subnet clients.": "为访客网络（VLAN2）客户端添加路由。",
"Push Route (Your Home subnet)": "推送路由（你的家庭内网）",
"Used to push route for Home Network to &quot;VLAN1&quot; (Trusted VPN) subnet clients.": "向受信任客户端推送家庭内网路由。",
"Push DHCP (DNS Server 1)": "推送 DNS（服务器 1）",
"DNS Server 1 configuration for connected Clients. For 'push \"dhcp-option DNS [IP of DNS Server]\"' configuration.": "下发给客户端的首选 DNS，格式为 push \"dhcp-option DNS 服务器IP\"。",
"Push DHCP (DNS Server 2)": "推送 DNS（服务器 2）",
"DNS Server 2 configuration for connected Clients. For 'push \"dhcp-option DNS [IP of DNS Server]\"' configuration.": "下发给客户端的备用 DNS，格式为 push \"dhcp-option DNS 服务器IP\"。",
"Push Redirect-gateway": "推送全局路由",
"When this option uncommented, the OpenVPN server push a default route to the client, which tells client to \n         route all Internet traffic through the VPN tunnel.": "取消注释后，服务端会给客户端推送默认路由，让所有上网流量都走 VPN。",
"OpenVPN Server Logfile": "服务端日志文件",
"This option is used to define the file where OpenVPN Server will save log messages.": "定义 OpenVPN 服务端日志的保存路径。",
"OpenVPN Server Logging verbose level": "服务端日志级别",
"This option is used to set the verbosity level of log messages generated by the OpenVPN server (0 to 4)": "设置服务端日志详细程度（0-4）。",
"OpenVPN Server Status Log file": "服务端状态文件",
"This option is used to set the file where OpenVPN Server will report status.": "定义服务端状态报告的保存路径。",
"OpenVPN Server Status Logging version": "状态文件版本",
"This option is used to set the version of OpenVPN Status report file. Used for openvpn-exporters.": "设置状态文件格式版本，供 openvpn-exporter 之类工具使用。",
